{"id":"vaquero","lemma":"vaquero","pos":"noun","rank":2997,"glosses":["cowherd, cowboy","jeans","squirrel cuckoo (Piaya cayana)"],"ipa":"/baˈkeɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"vaqueros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-vaquero.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nunca le he visto en vaqueros.","en":"I never saw him in jeans.","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"seen"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Los viernes voy al trabajo en vaqueros.","en":"On Fridays, I go to work in jeans.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440024","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"Friday"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"work, job"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Él llevaba unos vaqueros.","en":"He had jeans on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/525345","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"about, approximately"},null]},{"text":"¿Dónde te quitaste los vaqueros?","en":"Where did you take your jeans off?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687826","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to remove","l":"quitar"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"¿Viste la película de vaqueros anoche en televisión?","en":"Did you see the cowboy movie on TV last night?","words":[{"g":"you know"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"film"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"last night"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"television"}]}]}